        "text": "Using programming structures\nIn this section, we will show you how to use conditional and looping statements . They can prove\ninvaluable when creating advanced shell scripts. We will also show you how to use arrays, how input\nreading is used inside scripts, and how to format and print data for the output.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Using arrays in Bash\n\u2022 Reading input data\n\u2022 Formatting output data\n\u2022 Understanding exit statuses and testing structures\n\u2022 Using conditional if statements\n\u2022 Using looping statements\n\u2022 Working with functions\n\u2022 Using sed and (g)awk commands\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
